{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#card-zh","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-m3-monet 是一款面向 DSH 网页客户端的 Material Design 3 动态主题插件。它在插件设置页提供壁纸、调色和毛玻璃控制，并通过主题令牌覆盖应用配色。主要功能包括从图片提取种子颜色、按颜色生成亮暗主题、配置壁纸透明度、分别调整侧栏与内容区的模糊效果，以及保存偏好设置。适合希望自定义 DSH 外观并让界面配色随壁纸变化的用户。图片取色和主题设置在浏览器端完成，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:743","src/client-template.js:469","src/client-template.js:907"]}
{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#card-en","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-m3-monet brings a Material Design 3 theme to the DSH web client. Users can choose wallpaper, adjust colors, and tune frosted glass for the sidebar and content area. It extracts image colors, creates light and dark theme tokens, and saves preferences in the browser. No API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:743","src/client-template.js:469","src/client-template.js:907"]}
