{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#feature-1","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-m3-monet 的功能「壁纸动态取色」：启用图片壁纸后，插件会读取图片像素并提取种子颜色，再生成 Material 调色板；更换图片时会重新计算并应用新主题。（见 src/client-template.js:578）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:578"]}
{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#feature-2","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-m3-monet 的功能「亮暗主题令牌」：插件将提取的种子颜色转换为 Material 3 角色，并映射为 DSH 主题令牌；关闭美化后会释放覆盖并恢复宿主主题。（见 src/client-template.js:469）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:469"]}
{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#feature-3","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-m3-monet 的功能「壁纸与毛玻璃设置」：设置页可选择壁纸、调节界面透明度，并分别控制侧边栏和内容区的模糊、饱和度及不透明度。（见 src/client-template.js:743）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:743"]}
{"unit_id":"Regex520__dsh-m3-monet#feature-4","repo":"Regex520/dsh-m3-monet","commit":"54b38e653ba6e207c03169cb953037702537cb69","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-m3-monet 的功能「调色板控制」：用户可在设置页选择颜色来源和调色风格，调整色彩强度与明度，并实时预览主题效果。（见 src/client-template.js:743）","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client-template.js:743"]}
